<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Citicorp raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Citicorp raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Henry Dickson said he raised his rating on Citicorp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited the stock price.</p>
<p>-- shares closed up 1/2 to 118-1/8 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
